<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
iOS entitlements.

ONE entry, for one reason: CloudSession persists the Supabase auth session in
SecureStorage (Data/Services/Cloud/CloudSession.cs), and SecureStorage on this platform
is the Keychain. Without a keychain access group the store throws on the simulator in
Debug, which is where the cloud work will be developed, and the failure reads as a
generic security error rather than as a missing entitlement.

$(AppIdentifierPrefix) is substituted at build time with the team prefix, so this
resolves to "<TEAMID>.com.felova.app": the app's own default group, shared with nothing.
Do not add a second group. Nothing in this app shares a keychain item with another app,
and a group the provisioning profile does not carry fails codesign.

PAIRED REQUIREMENT: the App ID for com.felova.app must have the "Keychain Sharing"
capability enabled in the Apple Developer portal, and the provisioning profile must be
regenerated after enabling it. If it is not, codesign fails with a profile/entitlement
mismatch rather than with anything naming the keychain. See docs/history/IOS_PLAN.md
Phase 2, steps 2 and 3.

Deliberately NOT here:
  - aps-environment (push). Every reminder in this app is a LOCAL notification
    (Plugin.LocalNotification over UNUserNotificationCenter); there is no server that
    sends anything, so the Push capability is not needed and asking for it would be a
    question at review with no good answer.
  - com.apple.developer.applesignin. Sign in with Apple is not in v1: no social login is
    offered on iOS, so guideline 4.8 is not engaged (IsGoogleAvailable is already
    Android-only). Add this entitlement in the same change that adds the button, never
    before. See docs/history/IOS_PLAN.md §5.2.
  - com.apple.developer.in-app-payments. That is Apple Pay, not StoreKit. Subscriptions
    through RevenueCat need the In-App Purchase capability on the App ID and no
    entitlement in this file.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
    <key>keychain-access-groups</key>
    <array>
        <string>$(AppIdentifierPrefix)com.felova.app</string>
    </array>
</dict>
</plist>
